 3pc) & 2 bedrooms, including one cleverly HIDDEN behind a bookcase! Downstairs features a 3rd bedroom (or primary), 4th bedroom (or 2nd family room), exercise space & NEW 4pc bathroom. Kids will LOVE the yard with an amazing pirate ship play structure, half-pipe, volleyball space & apple tree, plus room for a deck, fire-pit & more! Complete with your own front yard garden. Updates include roof (2021), main sewer line (2022), HWT (2017), NEW exterior paint & parging (2026). Great neighbours & a great location close to downtown. This is a home you won't want to miss! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$369,000"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","4"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","864 sq ft"],["Lot size","6,220 sq ft"],["Year built","1953"],["Storeys","1"],["Neighbourhood","Sherbrooke"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5L4G5"],["MLS® number","E4504690"],["Listed","August 20, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Hood Fan"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage, Oversize"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","5.65m"],["Kitchen","Main level","5.65m x 3.87m"],["Primary Bedroom","Basement","3.40m"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.18m x 2.69m"],["Bedroom 3","Main level","3.68m x 3.99m"],["Bedroom 4","Basement","4.83m x 3.70m"],["Laundry room","Basement","3.61m x 2.86m"]],"courtesy":"Kevin Machado, RE/MAX Professionals","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"sherbrooke","area":"northwest-edmonton"}